{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>早上開始陸續有市民在宏福苑大火一周年到大埔廣福休憩公園獻花悼念，下午現場已擺放逾百束花。下午約4時半，一批民安隊人員到場，將花收入膠箱，移往草地。民安隊人員起初未回應收花的理據以及屬何部門指示，其後有人稱會將花移往後方存放，騰出空位。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T09:14:58.631740+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T08:56:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T09:08:20.278632+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T09:08:20.278632+00:00","content_hash":"d30d20d8a77dafb10e83e6cf5fbdc4bc107763b8e47ff7565f3290f678041979","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}